{
  "slug": "pwp",
  "name": "Pwp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Project Workflow Protocol — 11 systematic skills for debugging, code review, security audit, refactoring, migration, API design, performance optimization, project bootstrapping, testing strategy, deployment, and documentation lifecycle.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `pwp-api-design` (API design standards — consistent, predictable, documented endpoints), `pwp-bootstrap` (New project initialization protocol — from empty directory to production-ready foundation in one session), `pwp-code-review` (Systematic code review protocol — review code with rigor and specificity), `pwp-debug` (Systematic debugging protocol — diagnose, isolate, and fix bugs with discipline), `pwp-deploy` (Deployment protocol — safe, observable, reversible releases from main to production), `pwp-docs` (Documentation lifecycle protocol — living docs that stay current and traceable), `pwp-migrate` (Data and schema migration protocol — safe, reversible, verified migrations), `pwp-perf` (Performance optimization protocol — measure first, optimize second, verify always), and 3 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install pwp@claude-community` from `shandar/pwp-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
